type: dataset
title: "Primark Product Data in 17 Countries: Free Sample (1,000 products, 2026-10)"
abstract: "1,000 random products from Primark's UK range with their listings in every country that sells them (9,391 product rows, 48,968 size rows), snapshot of 2026-10-27: local prices and previous prices, categories, colours, sizes, materials, care, Click & Collect stock, store ranging counts, image URLs and on-sale dates."
